            "content": "",
            "html": "<script src=\"https://app.bluebirdclimate.com/embed/summer-fridays?id=A52_QqNR_2XtSXZ0BtIgqZ5el1Ux4DIrbQ_frRhjyAiH-Ht01ylbFDH-DcwvSRPFyoFyWZUbeoq2VqHEOR_u1kY72mdyy5zHRsRPBD3hjsoffw4-VTnEyA\" async=\"\" type=\"text/javascript\"></script>"
          }
        },
        "block_1_6X4eXk": {
          "type": "block_1",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Sustainability",
            "content": "<p>Learn more about sustainability <a href=\"/pages/sustainability\" title=\"Sustainability\">here</a>.</p>",
            "html": ""
          }
        },
        "block_2_dEtQXW": {
          "type": "block_2",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Is Jet Lag Deep Hydration Serum vegan and cruelty-free?",
            "content": "<p>Yes, Summer Fridays products are not tested on animals or contain any animal by-products.</p>",
            "html": ""
          }
        },
        "block_2_wipdLf": {
          "type": "block_2",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Is Jet Lag Deep Hydration Serum gluten-free?",
            "content": "<p>Jet Lag Deep Hydration Serum is formulated without gluten. It’s important to note that while all Summer Fridays products are formulated to be gluten-free, we cannot guarantee that they have been produced in a gluten-free facility. However, The National Celiac Association has stated that unless cosmetic products are ingested, there should not be an issue with gluten in topical products. <br/><br/>Please see <a href=\"https://nationalceliac.org/celiac-disease-questions/using-gluten-free-skin-body-products-someone-celiac-disease/\">here</a> for additional information. As always, if there is concern, we recommend that you consult with your physician/healthcare provider prior to use.</p>",
            "html": ""
          }
        },
        "block_2_PFnEJE": {
          "type": "block_2",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Is Jet Lag Deep Hydration Serum non-comedogenic?",
            "content": "<p>Yes, Jet Lag Deep Hydration Serum is non-comedogenic, which means it will not clog pores.</p>",
            "html": ""
          }
        },
        "block_2_xY79XQ": {
          "type": "block_2",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Is Jet Lag Deep Hydration Serum suitable for all skin types?",
            "content": "<p>Yes, Jet Lag Deep Hydration Serum is suitable for all skin types, including sensitive skin.</p>",
            "html": ""
          }
        },
        "block_2_Fw6LfM": {
          "type": "block_2",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Is Jet Lag Deep Hydration Serum fragrance-free?",
            "content": "<p>Yes, Jet Lag Deep Hydration Serum is formulated without fragrance.</p>",
            "html": ""
          }
        },
        "block_2_La8cqL": {
          "type": "block_2",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Can Jet Lag Deep Hydration Serum be cocktailed with other serums (ex: Vitamin C serums)?",
            "content": "<p>We recommend layering Jet Lag™Deep Hydration Serum versus cocktailing. This allows each layer to absorb into the skin for greater efficacy.<br/><br/>Cocktailing Jet Lag Deep Hydration Serum with products that contain active ingredients (such as Vitamin C or retinoids) may “dilute” the active ingredients. </p>",
            "html": ""
          }
        },
        "block_2_YTFDrk": {
          "type": "block_2",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Can I use Jet Lag Deep Hydration Serum with retinol?",
            "content": "<p>Yes. Jet Lag Deep Hydration Serum can be used with retinol and retinol derivatives.<br/><br/>We recommend applying your retinol such as Midnight Ritual Retinol Renewal Serum and then following with Jet Lag Deep Hydration Serum for added hydration.  </p>",
            "html": ""
          }
        },
        "block_2_AeE83k": {
          "type": "block_2",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Can I use Jet Lag Deep Hydration Serum instead of my moisturizer?",
            "content": "<p>Jet Lag Deep Hydration Serum was formulated as a serum to be used in conjunction with moisturizer. If you have oily skin, it can be used in lieu of moisturizer, however we recommend to layer Jet Lag Deep Hydration Serum under our lightweight Cloud Dew Gel Cream Moisturizer. If your skin is normal to dry, we recommend that you layer under a moisturizer such as Cloud Dew Gel Cream Moisturizer, Rich Cushion Cream Ultra Plumping Moisturizer, or Jet Lag Mask.</p>",
            "html": ""
          }
        }
      },
